WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Come closer, gently.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:09.267
I am a replica of the Capitoline Wolf, Rome’s gift to Timișoara in 1926.

00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:12.404
Below me are Romulus and Remus.

00:00:12.824 --> 00:00:19.302
Their story belongs to legend; the bond between the cities is a memory kept in bronze.
